{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"1ab41131f51ebc06","name":"card_unit_royal_ulster_rifles","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Britain/Allegiance/units/card_unit_royal_ulster_rifles","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"ROYAL ULSTER RIFLES","text":"When your HQ is damaged, deal that amount of damage to this unit instead.","flavorText":"The Royal Ulster Rifles was an infantry rifle regiment of the British Army and saw service in the Second Boer War, WWI, WWII and the Korean War. When WWII started the regiment was serving in India with 31st Independent Brigade Group which was trained in mountain combat. The brigade was returned to the UK and converted into a glider-borne unit and the name was changed to 1st Airlanding Brigade, a subordinate of the 1st Airborne Division. The brigade participated in the D-Day landings, the Battle of Normandy and later the Rhine Crossing in 1945 as part of the 21st Army Group.","faction":"Britain","type":"infantry","rarity":"Unique","cost":4,"operationCost":1,"attack":2,"defense":7},"defaults":{"Name":"card_unit_royal_ulster_rifles","title":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_royal_ulster_rifles_title","SourceString":"ROYAL ULSTER RIFLES","LocalizedString":"ROYAL ULSTER RIFLES"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":2,"defense":7,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Britain","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_royal_ulster_rifles_text","SourceString":"When your HQ is damaged, deal that amount of damage to this unit instead.","LocalizedString":"When your HQ is damaged, deal that amount of damage to this unit instead."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_royal_ulster_rifles_history","SourceString":"The Royal Ulster Rifles was an infantry rifle regiment of the British Army and saw service in the Second Boer War, WWI, WWII and the Korean War. When WWII started the regiment was serving in India with 31st Independent Brigade Group which was trained in mountain 